# GraphJapa

## Import

```svelte
import { GraphJapa } from 'markgraphy';
```

## Basic usage

```svelte
<GraphJapa
  title="example"
  animated={true}
  cols={60}
/>
```

<div class="live">
<GraphJapa
  title="example"
  animated={true}
  cols={60}
/>
</div>

## Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `title` | `string` | `—` | Caption drawn on the top edge as `[ TITLE ]`. Uppercase, 1–2 words. |
| `animated?` | `boolean` | `true` | Animate the marker around the mala. Default true. Reduced motion freezes a mid-mala frame. |
| `cols?` | `number` | `60` | Width of the scene in characters. Default 60. |
| `rows?` | `number` | `22` | Height of the scene in rows. Default 22. |
| `beads?` | `number` | `108` | Total beads per mala. The mala is 108; the counter shows current/total. Default 108. |
| `speedMs?` | `number` | `110` | Milliseconds per bead. Default 110. |
| `label?` | `string` | `'a breath for every bead'` | Short caption under the art; the art itself is decorative. |
| `class?` | `string` | `''` | — |

## Exported types

- `GraphJapaProps`

## Reduced motion

Animation is disabled under `prefers-reduced-motion`.
